    <statement><p>Let
<me>f(x) = 4 x^{1/3}(x^3 - 4).</me>
Evaluate the following specific values of <m>f'</m>:</p>
<p>(A) <m>f'(2)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>(B) <m>f'(4)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{4}{3}\cdot 2^{\frac{1}{3}-1}\mathopen{}\left(2^{3}-4\right)+4\cdot 2^{\frac{1}{3}}\cdot 3\cdot 2^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{4}{3}\cdot 4^{\frac{1}{3}-1}\mathopen{}\left(4^{3}-4\right)+4\cdot 4^{\frac{1}{3}}\cdot 3\cdot 4^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
